specs/hal-engine-spec-anchor-drift/spec.md:39:- If two candidates score equally the anchor is `unresolved` as ambiguous. It is never a coin flip ([validated by: refuses to guess when the context ties, and rewrites nothing](../../scripts/repoint-spec-anchors.test.ts#L193)).
